1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,528
AI can produce a polished answer
in seconds.

2
00:00:02,563 --> 00:00:04,359
But here's the uncomfortable question:

3
00:00:04,394 --> 00:00:08,753
did I learn it, or did the AI simply do
the thinking for me?

4
00:00:09,238 --> 00:00:11,258
Sparring changes that contract.

5
00:00:11,293 --> 00:00:16,395
I upload the PDF I actually need -
even a scanned page.

6
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:18,963
Private OCR recovers the text.

7
00:00:18,998 --> 00:00:25,128
Then GPT-5.6-sol builds a three-concept
map from that material alone.

8
00:00:25,613 --> 00:00:29,044
Before any explanation,
I make a quick prediction.

9
00:00:29,079 --> 00:00:30,777
It isn't a grade.

10
00:00:30,812 --> 00:00:35,975
It creates a real attempt I can compare
with one focused explanation...

11
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,708
...and its source anchor.

12
00:00:38,193 --> 00:00:41,275
Then I retrieve before feedback
and rate my confidence.

13
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:44,003
Here I'm very sure - and wrong.

14
00:00:44,038 --> 00:00:47,509
Sparring explains why my choice
conflicts with the source...

15
00:00:47,544 --> 00:00:50,626
...and why another relationship
is supported.

16
00:00:50,661 --> 00:00:54,522
That mismatch tells the coach
more than a score alone.

17
00:00:55,007 --> 00:00:58,123
Next, I teach the idea back
in my own words.

18
00:00:58,158 --> 00:01:02,325
If I only list parts, the AI asks
for the missing relationship.

19
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:04,776
I revise it; the explanation stays mine.

20
00:01:05,261 --> 00:01:08,101
Later, the objective returns
in new wording...

21
00:01:08,136 --> 00:01:10,257
...with no hints before I commit.

22
00:01:10,292 --> 00:01:12,772
Passing schedules day three,
then day seven.

23
00:01:12,807 --> 00:01:16,006
Sparring records practice evidence,
not permanent mastery.

24
00:01:16,491 --> 00:01:21,425
In the live demo, FastAPI keeps
the API key on the server.

25
00:01:21,460 --> 00:01:24,323
Structured Outputs enforce
the learning contract...

26
00:01:24,358 --> 00:01:28,464
...and every explanation and question
includes a verified anchor...

27
00:01:28,499 --> 00:01:30,535
...from the uploaded material.

28
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:31,728
Sparring:

29
00:01:31,763 --> 00:01:35,446
the AI study coach that refuses
to think for you.
